### How run the application
1.- Run ./abr-basic.sh
2.- The HLS chunks will be stored in he **output** folder

### How monitor the HLS streaming
1.- Run the ws_python.py code. It is a basic Web Server.

2.- Monitor using VLC
http://localhost:8080/master.m3u8

You can also monitor each rendition
http://localhost:8080/output_0.m3u8
http://localhost:8080/output_1.m3u8
http://localhost:8080/output_2.m3u8
